<title>AUSTRIA: SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT LATVIA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-AUSTRIA BEAT LATVIA 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria beat Latvia 2-1 (halftime</p>
<p>1-1) in their World Cup European group four qualifier on</p>
<p>Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Austria - Anton Polster 43, Andreas Herzog 74</p>
<p>Latvia - Vits Rimkus 45</p>
<p>Attendance: 15,700</p>
<p>Group four standings (tabulate - played, won, drawn, lost,</p>
<p>goals for, against, points):</p>
<p> Austria		3   2   1   0   3   1   7</p>
<p> Sweden		 3   2   0   1   7   3   6</p>
<p> Scotland	     2   1   1   0   2   0   4</p>
<p> Belarus		4   1   1   2   3   7   4</p>
<p> Estonia		2   1   0   1   1   1   3</p>
<p> Latvia		 4   0   1   3   3   7   1</p>
<p>Next match: Nov 10 - Scotland v Sweden</p>
</text>
